#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/051/KinGbz002_05189:TEXT_KINGBZ002_05189_SYSTEM_000_602:1"
msgid "You have learned the emote <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Pose of the Unbound</ui-edge-color></ui-color>!"
msgstr "Вы выучили эмоцию <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Поза свободных</ui-edge-color></ui-color>!"
